msgid "Security bug fixes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:14
msgid ""
"Improved protection against decompression bombs in :class:`~scrapy."
"downloadermiddlewares.httpcompression.HttpCompressionMiddleware` for "
"responses compressed using the ``br`` and ``deflate`` methods: if a single "
"compressed chunk would be larger than the response size limit (see :setting:"
"`DOWNLOAD_MAXSIZE`) when decompressed, decompression is no longer carried "
"out. This is especially important for the ``br`` (Brotli) method that can "
"provide a very high compression ratio. Please, see the `CVE-2025-6176`_ and "
"`GHSA-2qfp-q593-8484`_ security advisories for more information. (:gh:`7134`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:29 ../../../news/2.x.rst:197 ../../../news/2.x.rst:739
#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1453 ../../../news/2.x.rst:1650
#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:2204 ../../../news/2.x.rst:2547
#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:3161
msgid "Modified requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:31
msgid ""
"The minimum supported version of the optional ``brotli`` package is now "
"``1.2.0``. (:gh:`7134`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:35
msgid ""
"The ``brotlicffi`` and ``brotlipy`` packages can no longer be used to "
"decompress Brotli-compressed responses. Please install the ``brotli`` "
"package instead. (:gh:`7134`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:41
msgid "Other changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:43
msgid ""
"Restricted the maximum supported Twisted version to ``25.5.0``, as Scrapy "
"currently uses some private APIs changed in later Twisted versions. (:gh:"
"`7142`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:47
msgid ""
"Stopped setting the ``COVERAGE_CORE`` environment variable in tests, it "
"didn't have an effect but caused the ``coverage`` module to produce a "
"warning or an error. (:gh:`7137`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:52
msgid ""
"Removed the documentation build dependency on the deprecated ``sphinx-"
"hoverxref`` module. (:gh:`6786`, :gh:`6922`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:59
msgid "Scrapy 2.13.3 (2025-07-02)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:61
msgid ""
"Changed the values for :setting:`DOWNLOAD_DELAY` (from ``0`` to ``1``) and :"
"setting:`CONCURRENT_REQUESTS_PER_DOMAIN` (from ``8`` to ``1``) in the "
"default project template. (:gh:`6597`, :gh:`6918`, :gh:`6923`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:66
msgid ""
"Improved :class:`scrapy.core.engine.ExecutionEngine` logic related to "
"initialization and exception handling, fixing several cases where the spider "
"would crash, hang or log an unhandled exception. (:gh:`6783`, :gh:`6784`, :"
"gh:`6900`, :gh:`6908`, :gh:`6910`, :gh:`6911`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:72
msgid ""
"Fixed a Windows issue with :ref:`feed exports <topics-feed-exports>` using :"
"class:`scrapy.extensions.feedexport.FileFeedStorage` that caused the file to "
"be created on the wrong drive. (:gh:`6894`, :gh:`6897`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:77
msgid ""
"Allowed running tests with Twisted 25.5.0+ again. Pytest 8.4.1+ is now "
"required for running tests in non-pinned envs as support for the new Twisted "
"version was added in that version. (:gh:`6893`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:82
msgid "Fixed running tests with lxml 6.0.0+. (:gh:`6919`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:85
msgid ""
"Added a deprecation notice for ``scrapy.spidermiddlewares.offsite."
"OffsiteMiddleware`` to :ref:`the Scrapy 2.11.2 release notes "
"<release-2.11.2>`. (:gh:`6926`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:90
msgid ""
"Updated :ref:`contribution docs <topics-contributing>` to refer to ruff_ "
"instead of black_. (:gh:`6903`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:94
msgid ""
"Added ``.venv/`` and ``.vscode/`` to ``.gitignore``. (:gh:`6901`, :gh:`6907`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:101
msgid "Scrapy 2.13.2 (2025-06-09)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:103
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug introduced in Scrapy 2.13.0 that caused results of request "
"errbacks to be ignored when the errback was called because of a downloader "
"error. (:gh:`6861`, :gh:`6863`)"
