msgid "Scrapy 2.13.1 (2025-05-28)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:150
msgid ""
"Gave callback requests precedence over start requests when priority values "
"are the same."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:153
msgid ""
"This makes the changes from 2.13.0 to start request handling more intuitive "
"and backward compatible. For scenarios where all requests have the same "
"priorities, in 2.13.0 all start requests were sent before the first callback "
"request. In 2.13.1, the same as in 2.12 and lower, start requests are only "
"sent when there are not enough pending callback requests to reach "
"concurrency limits."
msgstr ""

