#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:320
msgid ""
"The ``start_requests()`` method of :class:`~scrapy.Spider` is deprecated, "
"use :meth:`~scrapy.Spider.start` instead, or both to maintain support for "
"lower Scrapy versions. (:gh:`456`, :gh:`3477`, :gh:`4467`, :gh:`5627`, :gh:"
"`6729`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:325
msgid ""
"The ``process_start_requests()`` method of :ref:`spider middlewares <topics-"
"spider-middleware>` is deprecated, use :meth:`~scrapy.spidermiddlewares."
