"requests via the :reqmeta:`autothrottle_dont_adjust_delay` meta key. (:gh:"
"`6246`, :gh:`6527`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1064
msgid ""
"If :setting:`SPIDER_LOADER_WARN_ONLY` is set to ``True``, :class:`~scrapy."
