#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1284
msgid "Scrapy 2.11.2 (2024-05-14)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1289
msgid ""
"Redirects to non-HTTP protocols are no longer followed. Please, see the "
"`23j4-mw76-5v7h security advisory`_ for more information. (:gh:`457`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1294
msgid ""
"The ``Authorization`` header is now dropped on redirects to a different "
"scheme (``http://`` or ``https://``) or port, even if the domain is the "
"same. Please, see the `4qqq-9vqf-3h3f security advisory`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1301
msgid ""
"When using system proxy settings that are different for ``http://`` and "
"``https://``, redirects to a different URL scheme will now also trigger the "
"corresponding change in proxy settings for the redirected request. Please, "
"see the `jm3v-qxmh-hxwv security advisory`_ for more information. (:gh:`767`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1309
msgid ""
":attr:`Spider.allowed_domains <scrapy.Spider.allowed_domains>` is now "
"enforced for all requests, and not only requests from spider callbacks. (:gh:"
"`1042`, :gh:`2241`, :gh:`6358`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1313
msgid ""
":func:`~scrapy.utils.iterators.xmliter_lxml` no longer resolves XML "
"entities. (:gh:`6265`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1316
msgid ""
"defusedxml_ is now used to make :class:`scrapy.http.request.rpc."
"XmlRpcRequest` more secure. (:gh:`6250`, :gh:`6251`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1325
msgid ""
"``scrapy.spidermiddlewares.offsite.OffsiteMiddleware`` (a spider middleware) "
"is now deprecated and not enabled by default. The new downloader middleware "
"with the same functionality, :class:`scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.offsite."
"OffsiteMiddleware`, is enabled instead. (:gh:`2241`, :gh:`6358`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1336
msgid ""
"Restored support for brotlipy_, which had been dropped in Scrapy 2.11.1 in "
"favor of brotli_. (:gh:`6261`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1339
msgid ""
"brotlipy is deprecated, both in Scrapy and upstream. Use brotli instead if "
"you can."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1342
msgid ""
"Make :setting:`METAREFRESH_IGNORE_TAGS` ``[\"noscript\"]`` by default. This "
"prevents :class:`~scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.redirect."
"MetaRefreshMiddleware` from following redirects that would not be followed "
"by web browsers with JavaScript enabled. (:gh:`6342`, :gh:`6347`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1348
msgid ""
"During :ref:`feed export <topics-feed-exports>`, do not close the underlying "
"file from :ref:`built-in post-processing plugins <builtin-plugins>`. (:gh:"
"`5932`, :gh:`6178`, :gh:`6239`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1353
msgid ""
":class:`LinkExtractor <scrapy.linkextractors.lxmlhtml.LxmlLinkExtractor>` "
"now properly applies the ``unique`` and ``canonicalize`` parameters. (:gh:"
"`3273`, :gh:`6221`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1357
msgid ""
"Do not initialize the scheduler disk queue if :setting:`JOBDIR` is an empty "
"string. (:gh:`6121`, :gh:`6124`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1360
msgid ""
"Fix :attr:`Spider.logger <scrapy.Spider.logger>` not logging custom extra "
"information. (:gh:`6323`, :gh:`6324`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1363
msgid ""
"``robots.txt`` files with a non-UTF-8 encoding no longer prevent parsing the "
"UTF-8-compatible (e.g. ASCII) parts of the document. (:gh:`6292`, :gh:`6298`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1367
msgid ""
":meth:`scrapy.http.cookies.WrappedRequest.get_header` no longer raises an "
"exception if ``default`` is ``None``. (:gh:`6308`, :gh:`6310`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1371
msgid ""
":class:`~scrapy.Selector` now uses :func:`scrapy.utils.response."
"get_base_url` to determine the base URL of a given :class:`~scrapy.http."
"Response`. (:gh:`6265`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1375
msgid ""
"The :meth:`media_to_download` method of :ref:`media pipelines <topics-media-"
"pipeline>` now logs exceptions before stripping them. (:gh:`5067`, :gh:"
"`5068`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1379
msgid ""
"When passing a callback to the :command:`parse` command, build the callback "
"callable with the right signature. (:gh:`6182`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1386
msgid ""
"Add a FAQ entry about :ref:`creating blank requests <faq-blank-request>`. (:"
"gh:`6203`, :gh:`6208`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1389
msgid ""
"Document that :attr:`scrapy.Selector.type` can be ``\"json\"``. (:gh:"
"`6328`, :gh:`6334`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1395
msgid "Make builds reproducible. (:gh:`5019`, :gh:`6322`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1397
