#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:1517
msgid ""
"Most of the initialization of :class:`scrapy.crawler.Crawler` instances is "
"now done in :meth:`~scrapy.crawler.Crawler.crawl`, so the state of instances "
"before that method is called is now different compared to older Scrapy "
"versions. We do not recommend using the :class:`~scrapy.crawler.Crawler` "
"instances before :meth:`~scrapy.crawler.Crawler.crawl` is called. (:gh:"
"`6038`)"
msgstr ""

