msgid ""
":class:`~scrapy.logformatter.LogFormatter` now supports some additional "
"methods:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news/2.x.rst:4081
msgid ""
":class:`~scrapy.logformatter.LogFormatter.download_error` for download errors"
